title:
Drugstore Makeup Tutorial for Oily Skin type 👍🏽

Makeup tips for #oilyskin 👇🏾 

- moisturize with oily control cream (oily skin is also dehydrated)
- face prep with a matte setting spray and with a thin layer of powder to absorb excess oil and create a matte canvas 
- use a soft matte or lumi matte foundation that is not fill coverage 
- use matte setting spray BEFORE, DURING AND AFTER MAKEUP
- set the face with thin layer of powder (set the blush and bronzer too)
- lock in the eyelids with a blurring primer and powder (this will control oil and help mascara not smudge)
@CeraVe Oil Control Moisturizing Gel 
@loréal paris usa 3 second setting spray and Extentionist mascara 
@Milani Cosmetics Mattefying setting spray and concealer + perfect powder 
@e.l.f. Cosmetics matte magic mist and set and liquid camo bronzer 
@Maybelline NY LUMI Matte foundation and Fit Me Concealer and Fit Me batter + Poreless Pressed Powder
@COVERGIRL Trublend skin enhancer blush stick 
@NYX Professional Makeup wonder snatch powder 

#oilyskinmakeup #makeuptips #drusgtoremakeup #fullfacedrugstoremakeup

